#
#  Example of input file for simulation of 256 flexible SPC waters 
#  by Path Integral MD
#
Main_filename 256spc_pi32
Verbose_level 6
Path_DB    ./moldb
Read_restart no
Dump_restart 2000
Check_only no

#
Molecule_types 1
H2O 256
#
#Box  10.  10.  10.
Density 1.
Change_V no
Change_T no
#
PBC rect
COM_check yes 0
#
Time_step 0.5
Number_steps 240000
Double_timestep  10
R_cutoff 10.
R_short 4.
Neighbour_list 20
Electrostatics Ewald 2.7 8.
Cut_forces 1.
#
Startup FCC
#
Output 1
Serie_avegare 20000
Average_from 3
Average_int yes
Dump_XMOL yes

PIMD 32
PI_thermo 298. 5. 4

Trajectory asccrd 10. 1000  all
#
End
